{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"revisions\":[{\"revision_id\":\"R001\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“head back to Irkkk”对应“回伊尔克去”，返回地点与行动一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R002\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“orb”与“水晶球”、“control the training facilities”与“控制训练室”表达的核心功能一致，颜色标记完整保留。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R003\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"对方因你的“mastery”留下深刻印象并传授驾驭更强能量流技巧的内容均已译出。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R004\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"两篇日志中的任务背景、阿尔德胡格的出现、兽人疑虑、巡逻情报及未知力量推测均与 source 一致，标题标记也完整保留。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R005\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“If you say so”译为“既然你这么说”，保留了基于对方说法作出回应的含义。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R006\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“infinite dungeon”对应“无尽地下城”。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R007\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"卡·普尔之名引发祖先逃亡传说、死灵法师建立不死军团并反复归来的信息均完整对应。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R008\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“Not enough money”准确对应“金钱不足”。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R009\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"半身人的出身、冒险动机、巨魔沼泽和卡·普尔废墟等核心信息均已译出，@name@及颜色标记保持一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R010\",\"verdict\":\"DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"把将要履行某事误译成已经收下某物。\",\"evidence\":\"source 是表示未来承诺的“I will, thanks.”，target 却是表示接受物品且动作已完成的“我收下了，谢谢。”\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R011\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"药剂商遭诬陷、受私刑、获救、接受反魔法观念并写下警告的完整叙事均与 source 对应。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R012\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"墓志铭中的姓名、年份以及桀骜、飞行无畏和死于黑暗的三项描述均已保留，格式标记一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R013\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“That thought will carry me in the dark places”对应“这份思念将陪伴我走过……黑暗之地”，亲吻选项及颜色标记也完整保留。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R014\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"获得龙族能力、解锁龙战士职业、职业特点以及自然失衡值和体力机制均与 source 一致，颜色标记完整。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R015\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"target 保留了“a letter to Aletta from the Master”中写信者、收信人阿蕾塔及信件关系。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R016\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“You can count on me”译为“交给我吧”，准确表达可以依靠说话者完成此事。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R017\",\"verdict\":\"DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"把刺客领主误译成盗贼领主。\",\"evidence\":\"source 明确是“the assassin lord”，target 却写成“盗贼领主”；“assassin”是刺客而非盗贼。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R018\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“Escort”准确对应“护送”。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R019\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"商队最后一名成员临死时的仇恨，以及“那天本该除掉你、你不配得到怜悯”的台词均准确对应，标记完整。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R020\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"标题、序号“(7)”及副标题“Into Darkness／进入黑暗”均对应。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R021\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“alter your basic properties”对应“调整你的基础属性”，意图和对象一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R022\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"战斗训练及其50金币费用、弓与投石索的射击天赋及其8金币费用均准确保留。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R023\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“[teleport]”准确对应“[传送]”，方括号格式保持一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R024\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“Never seen an undead have you?”准确译为“你没见过不死生物吗？”。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R025\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"攻击动作、对象 Krogar／克罗加尔及方括号格式均保持一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R026\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"每回合自然伤害、持续7回合、降低治疗量及移除一个随机负面魔法效果均已译出；%0.2f与%d%%的参数角色和顺序不变。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R027\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"三个日期、洞穴调查、水晶的魔法几何特征、巨腿与外来情绪，以及对水晶形态来源的最终推测均完整对应。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R028\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“[Follow him]”准确对应“[跟着他]”，方括号保持一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R029\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“Farewell.”准确对应“再见。”\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R030\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“What do you propose?”对应询问“你的建议呢？”。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R031\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"感谢内容和人名 Elisa／埃莉萨均对应。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R032\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"欢迎玩家来到 Last Hope、要求旅行者尽快说明以及时间宝贵的理由均已译出，@playername@保持一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R033\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"法杖能力、兽人行动、俘虏供词、高尔布格与传送门调查要求均完整对应；@playername@和#GOLD#标记保留。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R034\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"觉得事情奇怪并需要考虑的两层含义均准确对应。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R035\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“Light”对应“光系”，占位符[%d]完整保留且角色未变。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R036\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"只学习基础、揭示锁定技能类别及100金币费用均已保留。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R037\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"对该地点长期保密的惊讶、认为其有趣以及感谢信任的内容均与 source 一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R038\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"避免被蛇包围、后退逐一作战、休息恢复及使用技能、纹身和符文的全部指引均已译出，颜色标记和按键保持一致。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R039\",\"verdict\":\"DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"笔记所有者的人名译错。\",\"evidence\":\"source 明确写的是“Zemekkys's scribbled notes”，target 却写成“伊莫克斯潦草的笔记”，两个人名不对应。\"},{\"revision_id\":\"R040\",\"verdict\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"observation\":\"NO_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"“I will not let you down.”准确对应“我不会让你失望的。”\"}]}"}}
